THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

The session todo-list parser in this plugin (reading the newest completed
`todowrite` tool part out of the session history) is derived from the npm
package `opencode-todolist@0.6.1`, which is MIT licensed:

    MIT License
    Copyright (c) 2026 aiev
    https://github.com/aiev/opencode-todolist
    (tag v0.6.1, file src/tui-data.ts)

The algorithm (replay every completed `todowrite` into a chronological
timeline, the newest write is the current list) and the "keep an entry with an
unrecognized status" rule come from that project, where the routine is called
`latestTodosFromMessages` / `todowritesFromMessages`.
